## 2. Embedded acadrust component — MPL-2.0

The distributed WebAssembly binary `acad-rust_bg.wasm` is compiled from the
unmodified [acadrust](https://github.com/hakanaktt/acadrust) crate (crates.io,
`acadrust` v0.6.3), which is licensed under the **Mozilla Public License,
v. 2.0**. MPL-2.0 is a **file-level (weak) copyleft**: it applies only to the
MPL-covered source files of acadrust and their Modifications, and does **not**
propagate to the rest of this package or to a host application that links it as
part of a Larger Work (MPL-2.0 §1.7, §3.3).

This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License,
v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this file, You can obtain
one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

### Obtaining the MPL-covered source (MPL-2.0 §3.1 / §3.2)

The `acad-rust_bg.wasm` is an Executable Form. The corresponding Source Code
Form is acadrust, available at no charge from:

- Source repository: https://github.com/hakanaktt/acadrust
- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/acadrust (version `0.6.3`, used unmodified)

acadrust is used **unmodified**; no local Modifications to MPL-covered files are
distributed. Should this project ever patch acadrust directly, the modified
files will remain available under MPL-2.0 (preferring an upstream pull request
over a local fork). See the accompanying `NOTICE` file for attribution.

> SPDX identifier for the combined package: `(MIT AND MPL-2.0)`.
